    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73410" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμαρτ-ῇ</span></b> , Adv., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
